{"type": "post", "id": 6271, "title": "איך לתבוע חברת ביטוח על נזקי פריצה לרכוש עסקי?", "breadcrumb_html": "\n<p id=\"breadcrumbs\"><span><span><a href=\"/\">דף הבית</a></span> » <span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"breadcrumb_last\">איך לתבוע חברת ביטוח על נזקי פריצה לרכוש עסקי?</span></span></p> ", "content_html": "<style>\n.lvbl-article{<br />\n  --lvbl-accent:#8b6f47;<br />\n  --lvbl-ink:#5c4528;<br />\n  --lvbl-fg:#1f2937;<br />\n  --lvbl-muted:#6b7280;<br />\n  --lvbl-border:#e5e7eb;<br />\n  --lvbl-card:#ffffff;<br />\n  --lvbl-accent-soft:color-mix(in srgb,var(--lvbl-accent) 12%,#fff);<br />\n  --lvbl-accent-softer:color-mix(in srgb,var(--lvbl-accent) 6%,#fff);<br />\n  --lvbl-accent-chip-border:color-mix(in srgb,var(--lvbl-accent) 25%,#fff);<br />\n  --lvbl-table-border:color-mix(in srgb,var(--lvbl-accent) 35%,var(--lvbl-border));<br />\n  color:var(--lvbl-fg);line-height:1.9;font-size:1.1875rem;<br />\n  max-width:100%;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;overflow-x:hidden;<br />\n}<br />\n.lvbl-article img,.lvbl-article picture,.lvbl-article video,.lvbl-article iframe,.lvbl-article svg{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;}<br />\n.lvbl-article pre,.lvbl-article code{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;}<br />\n.lvbl-article .lvbl-table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;max-width:100%;margin:1.75rem 0;border-radius:.75rem;}<br />\n.lvbl-article .lvbl-table-wrap>table{margin:0;}<br />\n.lvbl-article h1{font-size:2.1rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--lvbl-ink);}<br />\n.lvbl-article .lvbl-h2{font-size:1.65rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.3;margin:2.25rem 0 1rem;padding-inline-start:.875rem;border-inline-start:5px solid var(--lvbl-accent);color:var(--lvbl-ink);}<br />\n.lvbl-article .lvbl-h2-lead{font-size:1.7rem;margin:2rem 0 0;padding:1rem 1.25rem;background:var(--lvbl-accent-softer);border:1px solid var(--lvbl-accent-chip-border);border-